--- the five ways a program can ask "how many CPUs do I have?" under --cpuset-cpus=0-1 ---
1. nproc (sched_getaffinity)          : 2
2. /proc/cpuinfo processor lines      : 10
3. getconf _NPROCESSORS_ONLN          : 2
4. /sys/devices/system/cpu/online     : 0-9
5. cgroup cpu.max quota               : 200000 100000
   cgroup cpuset.cpus.effective       : 0-1

--- and "how much memory?" under --memory=2g ---
a. /proc/meminfo MemTotal             : 8124516 kB
b. cgroup memory.max                  : 2147483648 bytes
